OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA bright start to Saturday
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells from the outset.
OL,7,FBecoming breezy through the morning,
OL,8,Fthen cloudier from the north during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon, with outbreaks of rain
OL,10,Farriving later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud around
OL,14,Fon Sunday before another area of rain
OL,15,Farrives from the west for Monday.
OL,16,FTurning rather showers on Tuesday,
OL,17,Fwith a risk of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
